{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-025",
    "title": "金丹劫前"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_138",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "陆照临张口，却发现自己发不出声音。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "顾氏旧库燃烧的同一夜，玄霄宗收到了一封没有署名的信。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4225,
          "end": 4225
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "信从北境雪原方向送来，封口处没有蜡印，只有一圈被烧黑的铜丝。掌门没有打开，先将信交给了沈砚秋。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4227,
          "end": 4227
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她在戒律堂偏厅拆开信封，里面是一张薄薄的证词纸。纸上只有三行字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4229,
          "end": 4229
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三百年前，太虚秩序启动。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4231,
          "end": 4231
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前，第二盏灯归还人间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4233,
          "end": 4233
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“今日，第三盏灯开始寻找欠债者。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4235,
          "end": 4235
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "落款处写着一个她很久没有见过的名字：沈砚秋。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4237,
          "end": 4237
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋坐在灯下，手指停在纸面。她知道这不是有人伪造，因为落款最后一笔会向内收，只有她自己写字时才有这个习惯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4239,
          "end": 4239
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门外传来脚步声。玄霄宗掌门的亲传弟子推门而入：“掌门要你解释旧档。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4241,
          "end": 4241
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“解释哪一页？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4243,
          "end": 4243
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“西坡旧阵、归墟灵城、顾氏封存工程。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4245,
          "end": 4245
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这些都已经封存。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4247,
          "end": 4247
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆照临带走了两枚残印。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4249,
          "end": 4249
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋将证词纸折好：“所以你们终于想起要问。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4251,
          "end": 4251
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "亲传弟子皱眉：“你参与过三年前的删史。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4253,
          "end": 4253
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我参与过记录整理。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4255,
          "end": 4255
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把三个人的名字从名册上裁掉，也叫整理？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4257,
          "end": 4257
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们的名字已经被太虚秩序取走。留在纸上，只会让更多人被牵连。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4259,
          "end": 4259
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁决定取走？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4261,
          "end": 4261
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋抬眼：“当时所有人都同意。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4263,
          "end": 4263
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏同意了吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4265,
          "end": 4265
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏有人同意，有人拒绝。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4267,
          "end": 4267
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4269,
          "end": 4269
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "偏厅里最左边的长明灯忽然矮了一寸。沈砚秋看着火焰，没有立即回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4271,
          "end": 4271
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他选择留下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4273,
          "end": 4273
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“留下做什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4275,
          "end": 4275
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“替我们守住一条不会被记住的路。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4277,
          "end": 4277
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "亲传弟子把一卷新抄的追捕令放到桌上。追捕令上不再写陆照临的名字，只写着“持印者”。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4279,
          "end": 4279
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“掌门要他活着回来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4281,
          "end": 4281
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4283,
          "end": 4283
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为两枚残印已经拼合过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4285,
          "end": 4285
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋的目光落在追捕令上：“拼合到什么程度？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4287,
          "end": 4287
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“只差第三枚，或一个真名。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4289,
          "end": 4289
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她低声道：“不是第三枚，是第三盏灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4291,
          "end": 4291
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "亲传弟子盯着她：“你知道它在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4293,
          "end": 4293
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我知道它曾经在哪里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4295,
          "end": 4295
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“雪原？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4297,
          "end": 4297
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋没有否认。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4299,
          "end": 4299
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她从案底取出一只旧木盒。木盒里没有法器，只有一枚褪色的铜钥匙和一张三年前的值夜记录。记录上写着：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4301,
          "end": 4301
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“冬至前七日，沈砚秋于雪原点灯一次。灯火未归，同行三人失踪。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4303,
          "end": 4303
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她把记录推给亲传弟子。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4305,
          "end": 4305
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是你的证词？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4307,
          "end": 4307
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4309,
          "end": 4309
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么现在才交？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4311,
          "end": 4311
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为当时我也忘了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4313,
          "end": 4313
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你怎么想起来的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4315,
          "end": 4315
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋看向窗外。山门方向的九盏灯中，有一盏在雨里无声摇晃。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4317,
          "end": 4317
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆照临碰过残印。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4319,
          "end": 4319
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他替你恢复了记忆？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4321,
          "end": 4321
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是恢复，是把被拿走的部分借回来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4323,
          "end": 4323
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "亲传弟子翻过记录背面，那里还有一行更小的字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4325,
          "end": 4325
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“若第三盏灯再亮，不得让持印者靠近雪原。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4327,
          "end": 4327
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你为什么没有遵守？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4329,
          "end": 4329
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋说：“因为那条规矩不是为了保护人，是为了保护秩序。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4331,
          "end": 4331
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "偏厅外忽然传来钟声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4333,
          "end": 4333
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "不是报时，也不是封山。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4335,
          "end": 4335
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "钟声一共响了三下，西坡方向同时升起一道青白色光柱。戒律堂弟子冲进来报告：“雪原有异动，第三盏灯正在向南移动。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4337,
          "end": 4337
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "亲传弟子抓起追捕令：“立即派人截住陆照临。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4339,
          "end": 4339
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋按住他的手：“不能截。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4341,
          "end": 4341
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“掌门的命令。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4343,
          "end": 4343
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他若真的拿到第三盏灯，玄霄宗必须先知道他看见了什么。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4345,
          "end": 4345
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以要活捉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4347,
          "end": 4347
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯在。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-100",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4423,
          "end": 4423
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "每一盏灯下，都站着一个失去名字的人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4567,
          "end": 4567
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯缓缓向他走来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4569,
          "end": 4569
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯架后方，露出陆沉舟的半张脸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4571,
          "end": 4571
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“照临。”他说，“现在还不是开门的时候。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-072",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4573,
          "end": 4573
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临抬手，挡住迎面而来的灯光。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4575,
          "end": 4575
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "金色裂纹继续扩大。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-074",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4577,
          "end": 4577
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第一道劫雷，在无云的雪原上落下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-075",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4579,
          "end": 4579
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "劫雷落下的刹那，陆照临没有感觉到疼痛，只感觉世界忽然安静。雪花停在半空，玄霄宗弟子的剑停在半途，顾长离伸出的手也停在距离他半尺的位置。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-076",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4581,
          "end": 4581
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "只有第三盏灯仍在移动。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-077",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4583,
          "end": 4583
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "它越过雪坡，越过营地，最后停在陆照临面前。灯罩内的青火映出一行雾字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-078",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4585,
          "end": 4585
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第一劫，问名。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-079",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4587,
          "end": 4587
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临张口，却发现自己发不出声音。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-080",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4589,
          "end": 4589
        }
      }
    ],
